    "type": "question",
    "label": "18",
    "prompt": "Let $c(x)=\\dfrac{3^x+3^{-x}}{2}$ and $s(x)=\\dfrac{3^x-3^{-x}}{2}$. Show that $(c(x))^2-(s(x))^2=1$.",
