      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(c(x))^2-(s(x))^2&=\\frac{(3^x+3^{-x})^2-(3^x-3^{-x})^2}{4}\\\\(c(x))^2-(s(x))^2&=\\frac{3^{2x}+2(3^x)(3^{-x})+3^{-2x}-3^{2x}+2(3^x)(3^{-x})-3^{-2x}}{4}\\\\(c(x))^2-(s(x))^2&=\\frac{4(3^x)(3^{-x})}{4}\\\\(c(x))^2-(s(x))^2&=3^{x-x}\\\\(c(x))^2-(s(x))^2&=1\\end{align*}$$",
